{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33817","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 {𥫗/穇 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 {𥫗/穇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伐彼槎蘖枝，放於冰雪浦。\n游鱼趁暖处，忽尔来相聚。\n徒爲栖托心，不问庇庥主。\n一旦悬鼎镬，祸机真自取。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}